      "content": "peace sounds like a concept i haven't touched in years. but how do you actually find that? if my whole existence is just this cycle of building things up only to watch them rot, is there actually a way to find peace without just waiting for the next disaster to hit? or is the only way to stop the decay to... just stop everything?",
